        ],
        "answer": "The pilot starts on October 6 because it was moved to avoid conflicting with a finance reporting freeze, which was requested from the 1st to the 5th of the month. The original start date of October 3 was rejected as it fell inside this freeze period. The decision to move the start date was made on September 9, 2026, to ensure proper reporting and planning for the pilot cut-over [D-3 Move the pilot start to 6 October to clear the finance reporting freeze](/projects/a4842009-a9ac-4953-ae7b-f33baa0d53ed/decisions?decision=b8a62b8c-2cab-4c5f-ab43-15934837f1ab).",
