        "answer": "The pilot was originally limited to eleven merchants instead of a proposed twenty-five because the vendor reconciliation service could not handle that volume at the time. This decision was made to ensure a manageable initial phase of the migration process. \n\nThere was a later decision to extend the pilot to fourteen merchants, as the harness was deemed capable of supporting the additional merchants at that point. For more details, you can check the [Steering committee minutes - September](https://projects.a4842009-a9ac-4953-ae7b-f33baa0d53ed/evidence?item=37d964c6-1828-423d-9aa9-affdc4031b00#evidence-37d964c6-1828-423d-9aa9-affdc4031b00) and the decision regarding the extension [here](https://projects.a4842009-a9ac-4953-ae7b-f33baa0d53ed/decisions?decision=d770cf54-f69d-4038-8eeb-adc86582cb07).",
