        "answer": "The legacy ledger will stay online for thirty days after the full cut-over because payment services rules require a dual-running window. This is not a choice made by the project but a regulatory necessity to ensure continuity and compliance with those rules. Decommissioning the legacy ledger at the time of the cut-over is not permitted under these regulations. This decision is documented as [D-6 Keep the legacy ledger online for thirty days after the full cut-over](/projects/a4842009-a9ac-4953-ae7b-f33baa0d53ed/decisions?decision=24115b73-5a21-4543-9621-e8272f7be0d9) and reflects the context of the architecture review call where this requirement was addressed.",
