        "answer": "According to the pilot runbook, the following preconditions must be met before starting the cut-over:\n\n- A replication slot must be created on the legacy ledger, with the lag under five seconds for one hour.\n- Eleven pilot merchants need to be flagged in the merchant table.\n- Nadia Rahman must be available for the security checkpoint two hours after the cut-over begins.\n\nThese steps ensure a smooth transition as described in the runbook draft ([Pilot runbook draft 2](/projects/a4842009-a9ac-4953-ae7b-f33baa0d53ed/evidence?item=150f4964-5fd7-4503-b08c-078cbc6b118b#evidence-150f4964-5fd7-4503-b08c-078cbc6b118b)).",
